{"id":"e9c2daf67c9f2e7b","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability.md","title":"真算术句与 PA 定理的严格区别","display":"thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability — 真算术句与 PA 定理的严格区别","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability","aliases":["91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability","91-thm-truth-stronger-provability"],"display":"thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability — 真算术句与 PA 定理的严格区别","depends_on":["[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability]]","[[91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness]]","[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability</span><span>91-thm-truth-stronger-provability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability — 真算术句与 PA 定理的严格区别"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c289f1c721012496\" href=\"?note=c289f1c721012496\" title=\"91-thm-Tarski-undefinability\">91-thm-Tarski-undefinability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"719296019c11ec36\" href=\"?note=719296019c11ec36\" title=\"91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness\">91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"84940566355062f6\" href=\"?note=84940566355062f6\" title=\"91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 为标准 PA 基础定理句集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TrueSent}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathrm{TrueSent}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 为基础真句集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ThCode}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\operatorname{ThCode}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 为相应代码集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}(\\rho,A)\\coloneqq\\forall a\\in\\mathbb N[\\mathbb N\\models\\rho(\\overline a)\\leftrightarrow a\\in A]\">\\(\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}(\\rho,A)\\coloneqq\\forall a\\in\\mathbb N[\\mathbb N\\models\\rho(\\overline a)\\leftrightarrow a\\in A]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 为通常可证性公式。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}stronger\\text{-}than\\text{-}provability}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{PA})\\subsetneq\\mathrm{TrueSent}_{\\mathbb N},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ThCode}(\\mathrm{PA})\\subsetneq\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}stronger\\text{-}than\\text{-}provability}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{PA})\\subsetneq\\mathrm{TrueSent}_{\\mathbb N},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ThCode}(\\mathrm{PA})\\subsetneq\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\in\\Sigma_1^0,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\operatorname{ThCode}(\\mathrm{PA})),\\qquad\n\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\;\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}(\\tau,\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\in\\Sigma_1^0,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\operatorname{ThCode}(\\mathrm{PA})),\\qquad\n\\neg\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\;\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}(\\tau,\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>PA 公理及推理在标准模型中可靠，给两个包含；Gödel 的真而不可证句给严格性。证明代码存在性给 Σ_1 定义，全真理则由 Tarski 排除算术定义。\n原稿一处将 True_N 当句子集、另一处拿它作自然数 Def 的输入，现用 TrueSent 与 Tr 分开。这里只比较集合和可定义性，不断言任意使用 T 的公理理论内部都可证 Prov_PA→T。</p>\n<p>来源：§5 的可证性编码；§8.6 的 Gödel 现象；Theorem 7.4 的 Tarski 限制。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-thm-Tarski-undefinability","status":"resolved","id":"c289f1c721012496","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"719296019c11ec36","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"84940566355062f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TrueSent}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ThCode}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}(\\rho,A)\\coloneqq\\forall a\\in\\mathbb N[\\mathbb N\\models\\rho(\\overline a)\\leftrightarrow a\\in A]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{